    rdfs:comment "Timestamp the recurrence-detection task wrote (or last refreshed) this alert. Polymorphic — also reused by S6.2 <https://w3id.org/IproK/site#SiteIntelligence> (auto-generated site-context report). Domain-free per antipattern #8 so RDFS inference doesn't cross-contaminate the two classes." ;
    rdfs:range xsd:dateTime .

<https://w3id.org/IproK/integrated#governedBy> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
