    rdfs:comment "Link from <https://w3id.org/IproK/billing#BOQItem> to the <https://w3id.org/IproK/tender#SORItem> that provides its rate. Null for star-rate items. Domain unspecified — antipattern #8." .

<https://w3id.org/IproK/integrated#governedByBOQ> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
